ge":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"The series follows the employees at the Genbu Shobou publishing company. Araki, who is a veteran editor for the dictionary department, is looking for a successor now that he's approaching retirement age. After Majime Mitsuya — a salesman who's a poor talker — meets Masashi Nishioka — Araki's coworker who is sociable and frivolous — Araki overhears their conversation and decides to recruit Majime into the department. The story follows \"the awkward humans\" Majime and Masashi as they work together to compile a medium-sized Japanese dictionary titled \"The Great Passage\" (Daitokai).\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Writing","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Work","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Skip","rank":76,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Educational","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Office Lady","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Josei","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":56,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Office","rank":55,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Marriage","rank":53,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Meta","rank":31,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"The Great Passage","english":"The Great Passage","native":"舟を編む","romaji":"Fune wo Amu","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"编舟记"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Fune o Amu"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"启航吧！编舟计划"}]},"trailer":{"id":"XOiIHHxMqE4","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XOiIHHxMqE4/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}